From 0d280fc96e7c26c8062d8e0e7da4dabc4a341e7e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saironcb <saironbusatto@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:34:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 36/44] feat: Arathi Basin defenders call out enemies at their
 node in raid chat

A raid group holding a node by order says in raid chat how many enemies are
at the node (and that it is under attack when someone is in combat), so the
leader can send help; one speaker per group, at most every 20 s unless more
enemies arrive, and "clear" when they are gone. Opt-in via
Playerbots.AbDefenderCallouts.
